stroy humanity this is just amazing  and haunting character development aaron  has done a complete 180  in terms of his current goals and  motivations compared to his initial  goals and motivations and yet within the  context of the story it makes sense we  know exactly why Aaron changed his mind  so drastically it makes perfect sense in  the context of that world which makes it  such a good story overall and that is  how this insane horrifying an incredible  chapter  I've been saying for months that I want  to see Aaron's new Titan form in greater  detail and I kept complaining about he  say I'm teasing us but now that I've  actually seen Aaron's new Titan form I  honestly don't know how to feel about it  this is not what I was expecting at all  that said I am really looking forward to  the next chapter and I am extremely  curious to see how this new Titan even  works and what abilities it possesses  let me know what you guys think  do you like Aaron's new form or did you  have nightmares about it like I did also  what do you think Aaron will end up  doing is he really going to go through  with his plan to destroy human  civilization will he perhaps stop after  obliterating the global fleet and  sending a strong message will he pull a  Lelouch or some other option also do you  think that this crazy new heir and Titan  form can even be stopped  don't be shy share your thoughts down in  the comments below if you enjoyed this  video you want to see more videos like  it please leave a like to let me know it  really does help and if you happen to be  new to anime uproar or maybe you just  haven't subscribed yet please consider  subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications you can also hit me up on  Twitter and Instagram at anime uproar I  want to give a big thank you to all of  our anime upper patrons for making  videos like this one possible special  thanks to all of our the one tier  patrons to want to rise above all other  clans including Ingrid ah a Lola Madame  the world Steelers acquired respect but  they have fun Jonathan King Brandon  Avila's Papa Smurf the school bus King  riser emperor otaku Ricardo Martinez  Thomas Jones Kinmen Oh Michael Hyde and  Jade and the vector and I can't forget  all of our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only Gilgamesh  nothing but a fan Jason Wilson King  zelgius Anatole Kazansky on hell cruise  critics beep Joe Stanton very Gucci  Alicia octor Jessica Kayla Fond  Kinoko me and water Bonnie parks Zoe  arch 12 rothwyn de hora Kraken our  Elle's and deadly Saint if you enjoy our  videos and you feel that they provide  value to you  consider supporting us on patreon even a  single dollar will give you access to  our peach and exclusive discord and your  name will appear in our videos along  with these amazing people as always  thank you guys so much for watching and  until next time see ya space Cowboys  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

